        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Step 2: Record the decision before effects&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=resil-step-2`&#10;&#10;- Pure reducer: frozen facts + policy then next action&#10;- Atomically reserve attempt budget + effect intent&#10;- One durable retry budget; no nested retry owners&#10;- Persist reason, scope, wake predicate + event cursor&#10;- Deterministic negative requires changed hypothesis&#10;- New user message does not reset attempt spending&#10;- Ledger unavailable then pause new managed mutations" link="resilience-contracts.outline.md#resil-step-2" id="resil-step-2"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L1"><mxGeometry x="625" y="140" width="550" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
