        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Step 3: Repair, reroute or wait&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=resil-step-3`&#10;&#10;- Repair only classified prerequisites with evidence&#10;- Reroute only to declared compatible capabilities&#10;- Checkpoint/split within the unchanged claim scope&#10;- Reconcile cursor + exact version/owner/provider wake&#10;- Unknown non-idempotent effect: inspect, never replay&#10;- Quarantine resources until end of access is proven&#10;- Independent work continues only if fully supplied&#10;&#10;Every recovery action returns through independent acceptance; an available process is not a repaired capability. In the app: `?node=resil-acceptance`" link="resilience-contracts.outline.md#resil-step-3" id="resil-step-3"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L1"><mxGeometry x="1215" y="140" width="550" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
