        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Step 5: Resume only the justified capability&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=resil-step-5`&#10;&#10;- Revalidate affected descendants, preserve others&#10;- Clear quarantine only on resource-release evidence&#10;- Expire old runtime preflight and reacquire live facts&#10;- Record liveness / unit progress / accepted progress&#10;- No ready work then durable wait, no repeated audit loop&#10;- Expose exact reason and next eligible wake condition&#10;- Unknown empirical results remain explicitly unknown" link="resilience-contracts.outline.md#resil-step-5" id="resil-step-5"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L2"><mxGeometry x="625" y="480" width="550" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
