        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Step 6: Prevent recurrence without blind tuning&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=resil-step-6`&#10;&#10;- Aggregate failure signatures by input/policy basis&#10;- Propose narrow policy change with deciding metric&#10;- Canary uses frozen baseline and bounded population&#10;- Independent reviewer accepts evidence, not opinion&#10;- Regression then restore prior admission policy version&#10;- Preserve failure history; never reset spent budgets&#10;- Roll back policy, not arbitrary already-run effects" link="resilience-contracts.outline.md#resil-step-6" id="resil-step-6"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L2"><mxGeometry x="1215" y="480" width="563.8" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
