        <UserObject label="" tooltip="CONTROL PLANE: Fail read-only&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=control-plane`&#10;&#10;- Lost durable decision or acceptance authority:&#10;- pause new managed mutation/admission in that scope&#10;- Keep cached read-only evidence available with age&#10;- Old outputs stay private/quarantined until reconciled&#10;- Do not kill external owners or assume children stop&#10;- Reconcile owner/generation and durable log on return&#10;- Unknown command outcome then inspect before retry&#10;- Wake: healthy durable authority + reconciled state" link="resilience-contracts.outline.md#control-plane" id="control-plane"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L3"><mxGeometry x="35" y="790" width="550" height="285" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
